## Architecture constraints

- Follow the high-level system design in `[system-architecture.md](mdc:architecture/system-architecture.md)`.
- Respect the application layering described in `[application-architecture.md](mdc:architecture/application-architecture.md)`.
- Keep data flow consistent with `[data-flow.md](mdc:architecture/data-flow.md)`.

## Implementation guidance

- Do not bypass established service or domain layers from the UI.
- If a change alters cross-cutting concerns (auth, logging, caching), consider writing an ADR using `[0001-template.md](mdc:architecture/ADRs/0001-template.md)`.

